&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; line-height: 13.6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 48px; line-height: 13.6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
